                                <t t-out="object.book_id.title"/>
                            </h3>
                            <table style="width: 100%; font-size: 14px; color: #ef6c00;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><strong>Author(s):</strong></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><t t-out="object.book_id.authors or 'N/A'"/></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><strong>Transaction #:</strong></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><t t-out="object.name"/></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><strong>Issue Date:</strong></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><t t-out="object.issue_date"/></td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Due Date Alert -->
                        <div style="background-color: #ffebee; border: 2px solid #f44336; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; text-align: center;">
                            <h4 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #c62828; font-size: 18px;">Due Date</h4>
                            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; color: #c62828;">
                                <strong><t t-out="object.due_date"/></strong>
                            </p>
                            <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #bf360c;">
                                Please return the book by tomorrow to avoid late fees.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div style="background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 4px solid #2196F3; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px;">
                            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #0d47a1;">
                                <strong>Need more time?</strong> You can renew this book
                                <t t-if="object.renewal_count &lt; object.max_renewals">
                                    (<t t-out="object.max_renewals - object.renewal_count"/> renewal<t t-if="object.max_renewals - object.renewal_count > 1">s</t> remaining)
                                </t>
                                <t t-else="">
                                    (no renewals remaining)
                                </t>
                                if it hasn't been reserved by someone else.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin: 20px 0;">
                            <strong>Late Fee Information:</strong><br/>
                            Fine per day: <strong><t t-out="object.fine_per_day"/> ₹</strong><br/>
                            Please return on time to avoid additional charges.
                        </p>

                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin: 20px 0 0 0;">
                            Thank you,<br/>
                            <strong>Library Team</strong>
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Footer -->
                    <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;">
                        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #999;">
                            This is an automated reminder. Please do not reply to this email.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </field>
    </record>

    <!-- Email Template: Overdue Notification -->
    <record id="email_template_transaction_overdue" model="mail.template">
        <field name="name">Library: Book Overdue</field>
        <field name="model_id" ref="model_education_library_transaction"/>
        <field name="email_from">{{ (object.create_uid.email_formatted or user.email_formatted) }}</field>
        <field name="email_to">{{ object.member_id.email }}</field>
        <field name="subject">OVERDUE: Please Return - {{ object.book_id.title }}</field>
        <field name="body_html" type="html">
            <div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #333; background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 20px;">
                <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: white; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                    <!-- Header -->
                    <div style="background-color: #dc3545; padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
                        <h1 style="color: white; margin: 0; font-size: 28px;">Book Overdue</h1>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Content -->
                    <div style="padding: 30px;">
                        <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #333; margin: 0 0 20px 0;">
                            Hello <strong><t t-out="object.member_id.name"/></strong>,
                        </p>

                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin: 0 0 20px 0;">
                            This book is now overdue. Please return it as soon as possible.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Book Details -->
                        <div style="background-color: #f8d7da; border-left: 4px solid #dc3545; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px;">
                            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; color: #721c24; font-size: 18px;">
                                <t t-out="object.book_id.title"/>
                            </h3>
                            <table style="width: 100%; font-size: 14px; color: #721c24;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><strong>Author(s):</strong></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><t t-out="object.book_id.authors or 'N/A'"/></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><strong>Transaction #:</strong></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><t t-out="object.name"/></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><strong>Issue Date:</strong></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><t t-out="object.issue_date"/></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><strong>Due Date:</strong></td>
                                    <td style="padding: 5px 0;"><t t-out="object.due_date"/></td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Overdue Alert -->
                        <div style="background-color: #fff3cd; border: 2px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; text-align: center;">
                            <h4 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #856404; font-size: 18px;">Days Overdue</h4>
                            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; color: #856404;">
                                <strong><t t-out="object.days_overdue"/> Day<t t-if="object.days_overdue > 1">s</t></strong>
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Fine Information -->
                        <div style="background-color: #ffebee; border-left: 4px solid #f44336; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px;">
                            <h4 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #c62828;">Current Fine</h4>
                            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: #c62828;">
                                <strong><t t-out="object.fine_amount"/> ₹</strong>
                            </p>
                            <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #bf360c;">
                                Fine rate: <t t-out="object.fine_per_day"/> ₹ per day
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin: 20px 0;">
                            <strong>Action Required:</strong><br/>
                            Please visit the library and return this book immediately to avoid additional fines.
                        </p>

                        <div style="background-color: #e7f3ff; border-left: 4px solid #2196F3; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px;">
                            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #0d47a1;">
                                <strong>Note:</strong> Fines continue to accumulate daily until the book is returned.
                                Your borrowing privileges may be suspended if the book is not returned soon.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin: 20px 0 0 0;">
                            Thank you for your cooperation,<br/>
                            <strong>Library Team</strong>
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Footer -->
                    <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;">
                        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #999;">
                            This is an automated notification. Please do not reply to this email.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </field>
    </record>

</odoo>